---
/**
 * Hex cursor layer (phase 7, item 15): a fixed, click-through canvas below
 * the nav on which src/scripts/hex-cursor.ts draws the magenta hexagon
 * lattice around the pointer. Rendered hidden – the script (loaded lazily
 * after `load`, only for fine pointers without reduced motion) reveals it,
 * so without JS or with `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` there is no canvas
 * on screen.
 */
---

<canvas class="hex-cursor" data-hex-cursor hidden aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<style>
  .hex-cursor {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 50; /* below the nav (100) */
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    /* Full magenta on night, subdued over the photos (hero, focus areas) */
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
  }
</style>
